--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c23573aac6c842542b1665777f9e3822, type: 3}
  m_Name: Flower Seller 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speakerName: Old man
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 74751e33f5fe7cc4d9e0cb5dc60e7bd1, type: 3}
    text: I used to bring flowers here every week. He loved them.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: Your son?
  - speakerName: Old man
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 74751e33f5fe7cc4d9e0cb5dc60e7bd1, type: 3}
    text: Yes... Though I can barely remember his face now. Strange, isn't it? Forgetting
      the face of someone you loved so dearly.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: I'm sorry.
  - speakerName: Old man
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 74751e33f5fe7cc4d9e0cb5dc60e7bd1, type: 3}
    text: A man once told me that memories are nothing but stories we tell ourselves.
      He said even the deepest sorrow could be erased.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: Who was he?
  - speakerName: Old man
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 74751e33f5fe7cc4d9e0cb5dc60e7bd1, type: 3}
    text: I don't know. He was kind, polite... and somehow, after he left, I couldn't
      remember what my son looked like.
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: ' Perhaps it was just grief.'
  - speakerName: Old man
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 74751e33f5fe7cc4d9e0cb5dc60e7bd1, type: 3}
    text: Perhaps. But tell me, young man... if someone erased your grief, would
      the person you lost ever have existed?
  - speakerName: Ashen
    portrait: {fileID: -1512766464214677766, guid: c3e96d18b70cd404aa460a0fcd1c3ec6, type: 3}
    text: ...I don't know.
  - speakerName: Old man
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 74751e33f5fe7cc4d9e0cb5dc60e7bd1, type: 3}
    text: Neither do I anymore.
